操作步骤:
1. 对交易 A 执行 transactionCreate（或 transactionUpdate）写入 paymentMethodDetails: {card: {brand: "Visa", firstDigits: "411111", lastDigits: "1111", expMonth: 12, expYear: 2030}}
2. 对交易 B 执行 transactionEventReport 写入 paymentMethodDetails: {other: {name: "Klarna"}}
3. 查询 order(id){ transactions { paymentMethodDetails { __typename name ... on CardPaymentMethodDetails { brand lastDigits expMonth expYear } } } }
